{
  "uid": "kentik-topology",
  "title": "Kentik: Geo Flow & Interface Health",
  "tags": [
    "kentik",
    "topology"
  ],
  "timezone": "",
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 3,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-3h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "5m",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "ds",
        "type": "datasource",
        "label": "Kentik datasource",
        "query": "kentik-connect-datasource",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "device",
        "type": "query",
        "label": "Device",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "kentik-connect-datasource",
          "uid": "${ds}"
        },
        "query": "values(/metrics/interfaces/counters, device_name)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": "__ALL__",
        "multi": false,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Geo flow & interface health\n\n- **Country flow graph** \u2014 nodes are countries (sized by total traffic), **lines are src\u2192dst flows** with bits/s on each edge. Built server-side via the backend `format: nodegraph` mode.\n- **Interface health** \u2014 per device + interface **utilization in/out**, **input/output errors**, and **discards** from NMS interface counters (`/metrics/interfaces/counters`), colored red when high."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "nodeGraph",
      "title": "Country-to-Country Flow (edges = bits/s)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "kentik-connect-datasource",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 16,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "nodes": {
          "mainStatUnit": "bps"
        },
        "edges": {
          "mainStatUnit": "bps"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "kentik-connect-datasource",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "queryType": "ude",
          "measurement": "/traffic",
          "metrics": [
            "both_bits_per_sec"
          ],
          "dimensions": [
            "src_geo",
            "dst_geo"
          ],
          "filterGroups": [],
          "filterConnector": "All",
          "vizType": 3,
          "limit": 15,
          "format": "nodegraph",
          "rollups": [
            {
              "metric": "both_bits_per_sec",
              "fn": "avg"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Interface Health: Utilization, Errors & Discards",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "kentik-connect-datasource",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Utilization In"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "percent"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "gauge",
                  "mode": "gradient"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "max",
                "value": 100
              },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "value": null,
                      "color": "green"
                    },
                    {
                      "value": 70,
                      "color": "yellow"
                    },
                    {
                      "value": 90,
                      "color": "red"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Utilization Out"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "percent"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "gauge",
                  "mode": "gradient"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "max",
                "value": 100
              },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "value": null,
                      "color": "green"
                    },
                    {
                      "value": 70,
                      "color": "yellow"
                    },
                    {
                      "value": 90,
                      "color": "red"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Input Errors"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-text"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "value": null,
                      "color": "green"
                    },
                    {
                      "value": 1,
                      "color": "red"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Output Errors"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-text"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "value": null,
                      "color": "green"
                    },
                    {
                      "value": 1,
                      "color": "red"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Input Discards"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-text"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "value": null,
                      "color": "green"
                    },
                    {
                      "value": 1,
                      "color": "yellow"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Output Discards"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-text"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "value": null,
                      "color": "green"
                    },
                    {
                      "value": 1,
                      "color": "yellow"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "Utilization In",
            "desc": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "renameByName": {
              "device_name": "Device",
              "name": "Interface",
              "in-utilization": "Utilization In",
              "out-utilization": "Utilization Out",
              "in-errors": "Input Errors",
              "out-errors": "Output Errors",
              "in-discards": "Input Discards",
              "out-discards": "Output Discards"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "kentik-connect-datasource",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "queryType": "ude",
          "measurement": "/metrics/interfaces/counters",
          "metrics": [
            "in-utilization",
            "out-utilization",
            "in-errors",
            "out-errors",
            "in-discards",
            "out-discards"
          ],
          "dimensions": [
            "device_name",
            "name"
          ],
          "filterGroups": [
            {
              "connector": "All",
              "not": false,
              "filters": [
                {
                  "filter_field": "device_name",
                  "operator": "=",
                  "filter_value": "$device"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "filterConnector": "All",
          "vizType": 3,
          "limit": 50,
          "format": "table",
          "rollups": [
            {
              "metric": "in-utilization",
              "fn": "avg"
            },
            {
              "metric": "out-utilization",
              "fn": "avg"
            },
            {
              "metric": "in-errors",
              "fn": "avg"
            },
            {
              "metric": "out-errors",
              "fn": "avg"
            },
            {
              "metric": "in-discards",
              "fn": "avg"
            },
            {
              "metric": "out-discards",
              "fn": "avg"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}